      "@id": "docs/concepts/architecture/theming.md#provenance-1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "(header)",
      "prov:value": "Bean `2krx`: every\n> time an instance names a directory as a subgraph it owes a **visualiser** and\n> a **documentation entry**. `cat-harness/skills/ui/theming/` arrives owing both, and\n> shipping it without them would manufacture the finding rather than clear it.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 2krx"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/concepts/architecture/theming.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "The axis, and why the ordering matters more than the names",
      "prov:value": "The owner asked for theming skills *\"broken up thematically\"* on 2026-09-20,\nand then chose the axis: **\"1 + 2, then specialized to 3\"** — three levels, not\na choice between three options.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/concepts/architecture/theming.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "The axis, and why the ordering matters more than the names",
      "prov:value": "Four rounds of\n*\"still not image\"* were one cause, and each round was one stage.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "still not image"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/concepts/architecture/theming.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "One flat directory, not one per stage",
      "prov:value": "Five declarations would owe five visualisers and five documentation\nentries under `2krx`, which manufactures findings on a repository that is\ntrying to clear nineteen. *\"Broken up thematically\"* is satisfied by the files.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 2krx"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/concepts/architecture/theming.md#provenance-5",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "What moved, and what deliberately did not",
      "prov:value": "`theme-art-intake` moved from `skills/tools/folio-core/` and **kept its name**. Ids\nare stable across a relocation while paths are not, so `skill_fetch` and\n`roles.json` resolve unchanged.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "folio-core"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/concepts/architecture/theming.md#provenance-6",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Looking at it",
      "prov:value": "Two of the first seven avatar boxes framed scenery, and the\noperations box was square, in bounds, and clipped the crown off a hard hat —\ncaught by the owner looking at a render.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "avatar boxes"
      ]
    },
